.TH DANBY-TABLEPENDULUM 1
.SH NAME
danby-tablependulum \- pendulum coupled through a hole to a table mass
.SH DESCRIPTION
A mass moves radially on a horizontal table while the remaining string supports
a swinging bob below the hole.  The fixed total string length couples table
radius, pendulum length, and angular motion.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps, R resets, and Q exits.
